<div type="commentary">
   <p><bibl><ptr target="bib:Srinivasan1983_02"/></bibl> (p. 68), who reads Aratyamakaṉ, suggests it is equivalent to Aratikalaḥ, a <foreign>biruda</foreign> of Narasiṁhavarman II Pallava.<note>See Arātikālaḥ, “he who is death to his enemies,” in inscription <ref target="DHARMA_INSPallava00055">Pallava 55</ref>.</note></p>
</div>
         	
